    x: "πr² = (22/7) × 49 = **154 cm²**.",
    note: "Radius 7 (and 14, 21) is chosen by examiners precisely so 22/7 cancels. Seeing a 7 in a circle question is a hint to use 22/7 rather than 3.14."
