    "x": "Because $A \\oplus B = K \\iff A \\oplus K = B$. A subarray between indices $(i, j]$ has XOR sum $K$ if $\\text{pref}[j] \\oplus \\text{pref}[i] = K \\iff \\text{pref}[i] = \\text{pref}[j] \\oplus K$."
