      "Wave Equation",
      "The **Fokker-Planck Equation**: $\\frac{\\partial p(x, t)}{\\partial t} = -\\nabla_x \\cdot \\left[ f(x, t) p(x, t) \\right] + \\frac{1}{2} g(t)^2 \\nabla_x^2 p(x, t)$",
      "Heat Equation with zero drift",
      "Navier-Stokes equation"
