          ["Jensen's Inequality", "$g(E[X]) \\le E[g(X)]$ for convex $g$", "Strict inequality for non-linear convex $g$", "Defines Evidence Lower Bound (ELBO)", "Variational Autoencoders & EM algorithm"]
